 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Transport",
     "texto": [
      "Трамвай (tram), троллейбус (trolleybus) and велосипед (bicycle) are means of transport. Пассажир is passenger and пешеход is pedestrian.",
      "Ехать (еду) expresses a particular trip in one direction; ездить (ездит) usually expresses regular or repeated journeys.",
      "For the means of transport, на + prepositional is used: на трамвае, на велосипеде. For the destination, на + accusative can be used: на работу."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
